<translate>
==== ManuallyRemoveSpentRounds ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Parameter for weapons. If the parameter is true, then the shells will not fall to the ground after being fired.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
ManuallyRemoveSpentRounds = true,
</syntaxhighlight>
</translate>

